File Index

/ArmyBuilder.tsx
Purpose: Army Builder screen — pick race×class units under a mode's budget (unit count for small modes, points for large). Classes shown as a collapsible tree grouped by BASE CLASS (each base class a pickable top node; its reclasses as children), alphabetical at both levels; rows show tier point cost (base 10 / reclass more) + damage boost/gimp + caster-level badges; palette filtered to legal classes for the race + team allegiance (per-side Allegiance selector gates CSR reclasses); save/load armies; start match. Single-select per unit.
